            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "aa06718 Fixes this for me! This commit solves my issue. \r\n\r\nThank You So Much - I really appreciate your fast attention to this issue and the effort on preparing a fix. This has been a great and encouraging exchange with the benevolent maintainer of mini.nvim.\r\n\r\nI confirm that aa06718 fixes #1006, based on the following quick check:\r\n\r\n- I obtained a fresh/new installation of  [nvim-win64.msi](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/latest/download/nvim-win64.msi) on a Windows 10 machine. By default, this installs nvim at a file system location containing a space character in its path:_\"C:\\Program Files\\nvim-win64\\bin\\nvim.exe\"_.\r\n- I am using the same environment otherwise, my _init.lua_ and all other involved software (Git for Windows) is held constant.\r\n- I followed the steps from our issue to reproduce my error and.....\r\n- Success! The COMMIT_EDITMSG buffer behaves as expected.",
